## Exemples

### Bons exemples ✅

```
feat(gitlab): add merge requests endpoint
```

```
fix(copilot): handle empty response from usage API
```

```
docs: update README with new CLI options
```

```
refactor(connectors): extract pagination logic to base class
```

```
chore(deps): bump requests to 2.32.0
```

### Mauvais exemples ❌

```
Fixed bug          # Trop vague, pas de type
```

```
feat: Add new feature.   # Majuscule + point
```

```
FEAT(GITLAB): ADD MR ENDPOINT   # Majuscules interdites
```

```
feat(gitlab): added merge requests endpoint   # Passé au lieu d'impératif
```

```
feat(gitlab): this commit adds the merge requests endpoint to fetch MRs from GitLab API   # Trop long
```

